'''Roasted Marshmallow''' (焼きマシュマロ, ''Yaki Mashumaro'', '''Roasted Marshmallow''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

